  "title": {
   "en": "Q, Koitte nan desu ka?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "Ｑ、恋ってなんですか？"
   },
   {
    "en": "Q, What is Love?"
   },
   {
    "ko": "Q,사랑이란 무엇인가요?"
   },
   {
    "es-la": "Q, ¿Qué es el amor?"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Searching with you, the theory of love and everything else.\n\nAoi is an office worker who isn't good at interacting with people, but one day, he meets a mysterious person called Q chasing butterflies in the park at night. As if drawn by something, Aoi chases after Q but is suddenly enveloped in a mysterious light and before he realises it, he finds himself on board a spaceship! Q was an alien who had come to collect living creatures! Through the various species they collect, the two who know nothing about love will embark on an adventure to find out just what love is!",
   "ja": "人と接するのが得意でない会社員の青井君は、ある日、夜の公園でチョウを追いかける不思議な人・Qさんに出会う。何かにひかれるようにQさんを追いかけると、不思議な光につつまれ、気が付くとそこは宇宙船の中――。Qさんは、生き物を収集しに来た宇宙人だった！"
  },
